   "cooked": "<p>The Gardens Swarm wg is responsible for the TEC software implementation and that the tech is ready and sturdy for the launch through a series of tests.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Meetings: Mondays at 8pm CET</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Where? <a href=\"https://discord.gg/ag5dxjK8gy\">Tech Spec voice channel on Discord</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>WG Lead: <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/sem\">@sem</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Discussions happen on <a href=\"https://discord.gg/ag5dxjK8gy\">TE-1hive channel</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1-CY39HVgHcpRFac10FME97pqPclHMrj2YsphOGYUDm8/edit#heading=h.4qr126s3qfr1\">Gardens Swarm Manifesto </a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Github Coordination</h2>\n<p><img alt=\":woman_mage:t3:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/woman_mage/3.png?v=9\" title=\":woman_mage:t3:\"/> Frontends</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/tecommons/tec-interface\">https://github.com/tecommons/tec-interface</a></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/tecommons/tec-convert\">https://github.com/tecommons/tec-convert</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/tecommons/tec-hatch\">https://github.com/tecommons/tec-hatch</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\":woman_mage:t3:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/woman_mage/3.png?v=9\" title=\":woman_mage:t3:\"/> Smart Contracts</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/tecommons/hatch-oracle\">https://github.com/tecommons/hatch-oracle</a></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/tecommons/marketplace-app\">https://github.com/tecommons/marketplace-app</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/tecommons/token-manager-app\">https://github.com/tecommons/token-manager-app</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/tecommons/conviction-voting-app\">https://github.com/tecommons/conviction-voting-app</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/tecommons/tec-template\">https://github.com/tecommons/te